{
  "genesis": 1,
  "//": [
    "SnapBack — one row of motion returns the whole object to rest.",
    "",
    "  all       — one track per animatable field of the object, in field-table order (G-22).",
    "  original  — the value of the target field's OWN binding, re-evaluated now.",
    "",
    "So `release` is a single row: `all` from `current` to `original`. It needs no duplicated",
    "literals, and it keeps working at a size the component was never authored at, because",
    "`original` re-runs the binding rather than remembering a number. Compare `pressDown`,",
    "which has to name each field it disturbs — that is the asymmetry `all` exists to remove.",
    "",
    "Nothing here is marked animated: a field is animated because a track animates it (G-21)."
  ],
  "component": {
    "name": "SnapBack",
    "base": "Button",
    "namespace": "app",
    "designSize": [
      120,
      40
    ]
  },
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "accent",
      "type": "color",
      "default": "theme.accent"
    },
    {
      "name": "surface",
      "type": "color",
      "default": "theme.secondary"
    }
  ],
  "shapes": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "type": "rect",
      "bind": {
        "x": "0",
        "y": "0",
        "w": "w",
        "h": "h",
        "fill": "mix(surface, accent, base.hover * 0.5)",
        "cornerRadius": "min(w, h) / 4",
        "pivotX": "self.w / 2",
        "pivotY": "self.h / 2"
      },
      "reactions": [
        {
          "on": "pressDown",
          "cancel": "restart",
          "steps": [
            [
              {
                "target": "scaleX",
                "to": "0.94",
                "ms": "90",
                "easing": "EaseOutCubic"
              },
              {
                "target": "scaleY",
                "to": "0.94",
                "ms": "90",
                "easing": "EaseOutCubic"
              },
              {
                "target": "rotation",
                "to": "deg(-3)",
                "ms": "90",
                "easing": "EaseOutCubic"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "on": "cancel",
          "cancel": "restart",
          "steps": [
            [
              {
                "target": "all",
                "from": "current",
                "to": "original",
                "ms": "220",
                "easing": "EaseOutBack"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "on": "release",
          "cancel": "restart",
          "steps": [
            [
              {
                "target": "all",
                "from": "current",
                "to": "original",
                "ms": "220",
                "easing": "EaseOutBack"
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cap",
      "type": "rect",
      "parent": "body",
      "bind": {
        "x": "parent.w / 2 - self.w / 2",
        "y": "parent.h / 2 - self.h / 2",
        "w": "parent.w / 3",
        "h": "2",
        "fill": "fade(accent, 0.8)",
        "cornerRadius": "1"
      }
    }
  ]
}
